{"id":"f753356251a9-0138","source":"references/pptset/【加赠】700页逻辑图形 (1).pptx","sourcePage":138,"slideXmlSha256":"245652ca50d2a7c0d084c59777a5f61c2a07c070f48eff80616e3446279be6aa","slots":[{"anchor":"s4-s610","text":"Global Business Services Maturity \nWheel GBM","box":[0.8409,0.1532,0.104,0.0681]},{"anchor":"s4-s657-s641","text":"Purpose, Vision and Values","box":[0.6859,0.4887,0.0881,0.0916]},{"anchor":"s4-s657-s642","text":"Operations","box":[0.7738,0.4616,0.0741,0.0322]},{"anchor":"s4-s657-s643","text":"Strategy","box":[0.6116,0.4616,0.0741,0.0322]},{"anchor":"s4-s657-s644","text":"Controls and Measurement","box":[0.6929,0.6535,0.0741,0.0815]},{"anchor":"s4-s657-s645","text":"5.\nGovernance","box":[0.7349,0.2304,0.0741,0.0479]},{"anchor":"s4-s657-s646","text":"6. \nService \nDelivery Processes","box":[0.8094,0.2815,0.0741,0.0883]},{"anchor":"s4-s657-s647","text":"7.\nHuman \nCapital","box":[0.8498,0.4252,0.0741,0.0681]},{"anchor":"s4-s657-s648","text":"8. \nEnabling Technology and Digital","box":[0.8544,0.5593,0.0648,0.0883]},{"anchor":"s4-s657-s649","text":"9. \nFinancial Management","box":[0.8091,0.6984,0.0741,0.0681]},{"anchor":"s4-s657-s650","text":"10. Operational Performance and Partner Management","box":[0.7323,0.7639,0.0726,0.0883]},{"anchor":"s4-s657-s651","text":"11.\nTalent Management","box":[0.6507,0.7741,0.0741,0.0681]},{"anchor":"s4-s657-s652","text":"12. \nRisk Management","box":[0.5778,0.6984,0.0741,0.0681]},{"anchor":"s4-s657-s653","text":"1.\nService \nScope","box":[0.5372,0.5695,0.0741,0.0681]},{"anchor":"s4-s657-s654","text":"2.\nOperating \nModel","box":[0.5364,0.4252,0.0741,0.0681]},{"anchor":"s4-s657-s655","text":"3. \nLocation \nModel","box":[0.5805,0.2916,0.0741,0.0681]},{"anchor":"s4-s657-s656","text":"4. \nSourcing\nModel","box":[0.6528,0.2202,0.0741,0.0681]},{"anchor":"s658","text":"1. Service Scope","box":[0.0638,0.2273,0.0881,0.0299]},{"anchor":"s659","text":"Confirm which processes and roles across business units or geographies are to be managed the GBS. Translate customer request into new services.","box":[0.0638,0.2573,0.2201,0.0681]},{"anchor":"s661","text":"2. Operating Model","box":[0.2917,0.2273,0.1261,0.0299]},{"anchor":"s662","text":"Establish a GBS operating model that supports portfolio agility and can respond to disruptive technologies as well as VUCA environment.","box":[0.2917,0.2573,0.2091,0.0681]},{"anchor":"s664","text":"3. Location Model","box":[0.0638,0.3318,0.0881,0.0299]},{"anchor":"s665","text":"Confirm existing core locations and assess service portfolio of high-cost sites. Evaluate location portfolio to balance strategic coverage","box":[0.0638,0.3618,0.2201,0.0681]},{"anchor":"s667","text":"4. Sourcing Model","box":[0.2917,0.3318,0.1261,0.0299]},{"anchor":"s668","text":"Evaluate service delivery models across internal captive options and BPO for efficiency and specialisation.","box":[0.2917,0.3618,0.2091,0.0681]},{"anchor":"s670","text":"5. Governance","box":[0.0638,0.4353,0.0881,0.0299]},{"anchor":"s671","text":"Build partnership with the business and foster end-to-end integration in terms of policy setting and operational steering.","box":[0.0638,0.4653,0.2201,0.0681]},{"anchor":"s673","text":"6. Service Delivery Processes","box":[0.2917,0.4353,0.1505,0.0299]},{"anchor":"s674","text":"Manage service delivery efficiently. Embrace innovation and continuous improvement.","box":[0.2917,0.4653,0.2091,0.0479]},{"anchor":"s676","text":"7. Human Capital","box":[0.0638,0.5389,0.0881,0.0299]},{"anchor":"s677","text":"Establish the right workplace mix to achieve and appropriate balance between delivery, continuous improvement, and value creation. Efficiently structure the retained organization.","box":[0.0638,0.5689,0.2201,0.0883]},{"anchor":"s679","text":"8. Enabling Technology and Digital","box":[0.2917,0.5389,0.1823,0.0299]},{"anchor":"s680","text":"Leverage latest technology in intelligent automation, analytics, cloud computing and leverage ERP tools for workflow solutions.","box":[0.2917,0.5689,0.2091,0.0681]},{"anchor":"s5-s682","text":"9. Financial Management","box":[0.0638,0.6628,0.1287,0.0299]},{"anchor":"s5-s683","text":"Benchmark cost against peers. Implement efficient chargeback process.","box":[0.0638,0.6928,0.2201,0.0479]},{"anchor":"s6-s685","text":"10. Operational Performance and Partner Management","box":[0.2917,0.6628,0.1823,0.0524]},{"anchor":"s6-s686","text":"Determine appropriate service levels and measure customer satisfaction. Manage partners delivery BPOs via a holistic performance framework.","box":[0.2917,0.715,0.2187,0.0681]},{"anchor":"s7-s688","text":"11. Talent Management","box":[0.0638,0.7951,0.1319,0.0299]},{"anchor":"s7-s689","text":"Invest in providing attractive career paths and foster employee development. Align Employee Performance metrics with GBS KPIs.","box":[0.0638,0.8252,0.2201,0.0681]},{"anchor":"s8-s691","text":"12. Risk Management","box":[0.2917,0.7951,0.1823,0.0299]},{"anchor":"s8-s692","text":"Balance reactive with proactive controls and introduce automation.","box":[0.2917,0.8252,0.2091,0.0479]},{"anchor":"s3","text":"Maturity Assessment Global Business Services (GBS)","box":[0.0283,0.0378,0.9417,0.0673]}],"warnings":[],"stats":{"objects":79,"textBlocks":42},"reconstructedSlots":[{"anchor":"text-0","text":"Global Business ","box":[0.8557300797677126,0.1603459393536603,0.07736943612018594,0.016692592479564526],"origin":[0.8557300797677126,0.17370000768590857],"font":"DejaVuSans","size":9.013999938964844,"resolvedFamily":"DejaVu Sans"},{"anchor":"text-1","text":"Services Maturity ","box":[0.8506218054212036,0.18034591674804687,0.0845994877547835,0.016692592479564526],"origin":[0.8506218054212036,0.19369998508029515],"font":"DejaVuSans","size":9.013999938964844,"resolvedFamily":"DejaVu Sans"},{"anchor":"text-2","text":"Wheel GBM","box":[0.8658279289672223,0.20034595065646701,0.05405290106457615,0.016692592479564526],"origin":[0.8658279289672223,0.21370001898871527],"font":"DejaVuSans","size":9.01